## Hooks discipline (MUST)

Full contract: [ai_react_hooks_guidelines.md](docs/guidelines/react/ai_react_hooks_guidelines.md).

- **Rules of Hooks** — top level only, only from components/custom hooks; component body stays a pure render (no `fetch`/`localStorage`/timers outside `useEffect`).
- **`useState`** — never mutate directly (`prev => ...` / new array/object); derived values (`fullName`, formatted totals) computed in render, not synced via `useEffect`.
- **`useEffect`** — never pass an `async` function directly; declare it inside and invoke. Always clean up subscriptions/timers/in-flight requests (`AbortController` for fetch — [ai_data_fetching_patterns.md](docs/guidelines/nextjs/ai_data_fetching_patterns.md) §4).
- **`useRef`** — for mutable values that must not trigger a re-render (render counters, prev-prop tracking, DOM refs); do not model them with `useState`.
- **`use()`** — Promise must be stable across renders (parent-created/memoized); consumer wrapped in `<Suspense>` + `ErrorBoundary`.
- Hand-rolled async UI state (rare — prefer `useActionState`/RSC) → discriminated union (`{ status: 'idle'|'loading'|'success'|'error' }`), not independent `isLoading`/`isError` booleans.
- **Memoization** — measure before `useMemo`/`useCallback`/`memo` (no default use); always memoize Context Provider `value`. **`useLayoutEffect`** — default to `useEffect`, switch only for a measured pre-paint flash. **`useTransition`** — never disable/block the triggering input while `isPending`. **`useId`** — SSR-safe DOM/aria ids, never a list `key`. **`useSyncExternalStore`** — required for subscribing to non-React sources (avoids tearing). Full detail: [ai_react_hooks_guidelines.md](docs/guidelines/react/ai_react_hooks_guidelines.md) §11–§14.
- **Custom hooks** — one concern per hook (no "god hooks"); return a named object once 3+ values; never return JSX.

## State management

Default to `useState`/`useReducer` + Server Components — reach for a client store only for genuinely cross-cutting state. Decision table + full rules: **react-state-management**, [ai_react_state_management_guidelines.md](docs/guidelines/react/ai_react_state_management_guidelines.md).

- **Zustand/Redux Toolkit — always select narrowly** (`useStore(s => s.count)` / `useSelector`), never destructure the whole store.
- **Never a module-level store singleton on the server** in Next.js App Router — per-request/per-user state must use a store-per-request pattern (`useRef` in a Provider), or it leaks between users.

## React Compiler

When `reactCompiler: true` in `next.config.ts` — do not add `memo` / `useCallback` / `useMemo` without profiled need. Follow [Rules of React](https://react.dev/reference/rules).

## shadcn/ui

Use **shadcn MCP** before hand-rolling primitives. Adapt to {{DESIGN_SYSTEM_NAME}} tokens. Primitives are **Base UI** (`shadcn init -b base`, style `base-vega`) — **ui-design-system-shadcn**, a11y in **ui-semantics-a11y**.

